  "benefits_features_and_faqs": {
    "about_overview": "AU Vetta Credit Card is a suitable option for consumers who want to earn accelerated rewards on everyday spends. Cardholders can earn 4 reward points per Rs. 100 on grocery and departmental store purchases, 2 points on other retail spends, and 1 point on utility and telecom payments. The accumulated rewards can be redeemed for e-vouchers, merchandise, mobile/DTH recharges, or flight/hotel bookings. Apart from rewards, the card offers several benefits for frequent travellers, including complimentary domestic & international lounge visits, railway lounge access, and 24×7 concierge services. Cardholders can also earn up to 1,500 bonus rewards through milestone benefits.",
